e in the  in the original repository so i thought  i was able to be  a conference driven editor but i failed  so  i'm still like um making the last  changes  so is this really the end of the project  now that the book is ready  um this started in 2018 but i think it's  a project that will last forever  because what we have created is not just  a translation and a book package what we  created was human and technical  infrastructure  to shorten the language gap that  currently exists  and i think our big contribution  developing the datas package  was creating brand new errors because  people now if they  fail using the package they are not  going to find  like um ways to solve it  alone but i think this is a opportunity  because in each failing is a way to make  our communities stronger  so thank you very much  so once again so once again if you'd  like to ask a question  we use the app app.sli.do  we one question here have you seen an  increase in spanish speaking our users  since the release of the package uh yes  i think  um so we put the book online  uh from the beginning so you can start  like  using the chapters some of them were  translated very  fast so yeah there are many people that  are using the package to teach  so it has that now alive outside the  book translation  fabulous that's the only question we  have  well please thank you

